# The build context is an allowlist: only what the Dockerfile reads is sent to the builder.
# If the build needs a new top-level file, add it here.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!index.html
!vite.config.ts
!tsconfig*.json
!public/
!src/
!server/

# Never sent, even from inside an allowed folder: secrets, installed or built output, test
# output, the mock checkout and version control.
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/.npmrc
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/coverage
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
**/.mock
**/.git
**/*.log
